while it looks good but I would change this line:
JavaScript:
window.getDirectionalReflection = function() {
        return Boolean(directionalReflection);
    };

// too

    window.getDirectionalReflection = function() {
        return JSON.parse(directionalReflection);
    };
as Boolean is no reliable and give unexpected behaviors.
also, I would change "var" to "let" or "const" as the plugin commands used, to "let".
I didn't check the entire code, or have use for it, but just a friendly feedback.
I cannot tell why the error occurs or which line, but it would be probably a simple fix.
good luck with the plugin
